# 默认：由 git 自动判断文本/二进制，并在提交时统一为 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本用 CRLF，方便记事本 / PowerShell ISE 打开
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不参与 diff
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pak binary
*.bin binary
*.dat binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary

# 徽章 / 统计：让 GitHub 识别为文档而非代码
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
LICENSE linguist-documentation

# 生成的产物不参与语言统计
dist/** linguist-vendored
